<p>Put your favorite collectibles on display with these sleek, minimalist shelves—designed specifically to showcase Smiski, Sonny Angel, Labubu, Crybaby, and other small art toys!</p>
<p>🧸✨ Whether you''re organizing your growing collection or curating a themed setup, these shelves make the perfect home for your minis.</p>
<p>📐 Shelf Variants &amp; Dimensions (W x H x D):<br>Style A: 18cm x 25cm x 5cm (7.1in x 9.8in x 2in)<br>Style B: 18cm x 25cm x 5cm (7.1in x 9.8in x 2in)<br>Style C: 19cm x 25cm x 5cm (7.5in x 9.8in x 2in)<br>Style D: 15cm x 23cm x 3cm (5.9in x 9in x 1.2in)<br>Style E: 17cm x 25cm x 5cm (6.7in x 9.8in x 2in)<br>Style F: 18.5cm x 25cm x 5cm (7.3in x 9.8in x 2in)</p>
<p>🖤 Features:<br>Made from eco-friendly, lightweight PLA<br>3D printed and hand-finished for clean lines<br>Multiple styles to match your vibe and space<br>Great for toy collectors, miniatures fans, and shelfie lovers<br>Easy to mount or stand upright<br>Perfect for personal display or gifting to your fellow art toy enthusiasts.</p>
<p>📦 Made to order – please allow 5-7 business days for production.<br>📬 Ships from Vietnam. Delivery to the US: approximately 8–12 days.</p>
