<p>With its compact yet solid form, this pot is ideal for air plants, small succulents, or decorative greenery. Thick walls provide a sturdy feel while keeping the design lightweight and elegant.</p>
<p>The subtle texture from high-quality 3D printing adds character without distracting from the simple form, making it easy to style on desks, shelves, windowsills, or workspaces.</p>
<p>📏 Size<br>• Height: 1.6 inches<br>• Width / Diameter: approximately 2.4–3 inches<br>• Compact size – perfect for small plants and minimalist decor</p>
<p>🧱 Material<br>• High-quality 3D printed plastic<br>• Durable, lightweight, and easy to clean</p>
<p>🎨 Design<br>• Round cup shape<br>• Soft curved body, wide mouth, gently rounded base<br>• Clean white finish, minimalist aesthetic</p>
<p>🛠️ Production &amp; Shipping<br>• Made to order: 3–5 business days<br>• Shipping from Vietnam: 8–12 business days<br>• Carefully packed for safe international delivery</p>
