<p>✨ HIGHLIGHTS<br>🔗 Connects compatible 5-tier and 3-tier shelves<br>🧩 Modular design for flexible display setups<br>🖨️ 3D printed construction<br>📦 Helps expand your collectible display space<br>✨ Great for mini figures, small collectibles, and decorative items<br>🏠 Suitable for home, desk, shelf, or collector displays</p>
<p>🛠️ HOW TO USE<br>🔧 Place the connector between the compatible shelf sections.<br>🧩 Align the connecting parts.<br>📚 Add your shelves and arrange your collection.</p>
<p>💡 Display setup: Combine different shelf sections to create a larger modular display wall for your collection.</p>
<p>🎁 PERFECT FOR<br>🎀 Collectible Displays<br>🧸 Mini Figures<br>🏠 Room Decor<br>🖥️ Desk Setup<br>🎨 Hobby Collections<br>🎁 Gifts for Collectors</p>
