<p>This 5-tier mansion version includes beautifully designed miniature home details such as chairs, shelves, lamps, staircases, plant pots, bed, washing machine, sink, toilet, bathtub, decorative boat, room dividers, and storage furniture to create a realistic tiny home atmosphere.</p>
<p>Perfect for collectors who want a statement display piece that feels like a complete miniature home.</p>
<p>⚠️ Smiski figures are NOT included — display shelf only.</p>
<p>WHAT’S INCLUDED<br>✨ 1 Giant Smiski House Mansion Shelf (5 Tier Version)</p>
<p>Built-in miniature furniture &amp; decor included:</p>
<p>🪑 Mini chairs &amp; table set<br>💡 Ceiling lamps<br>🪜 Staircases<br>🗄️ Shelves &amp; storage units<br>🪴 Mini plant pots<br>🛏️ Mini bed<br>🧺 Washing machine<br>🚰 Sink &amp; vanity area<br>🚽 Toilet<br>🚢 Decorative boat</p>
<p>❌ Smiski figures are NOT included</p>
<p>MATERIALS<br>High-quality 3D Printed PLA<br>Lightweight &amp; durable<br>Matte finish<br>Carefully assembled details</p>
<p>SIZE / SCALE<br>Perfect for:<br>Smiski figure display<br>Sonny Angel display<br>Blind box collections<br>Miniature room styling<br>Desk &amp; shelf decor<br>Cozy aesthetic setups</p>
<p>Fits most small collectible figures and mini decor items.</p>
<p>HIGHLIGHTS<br>✨ Giant 5-tier mansion shelf design<br>✨ Includes built-in miniature furniture &amp; home details<br>✨ Cozy miniature house aesthetic<br>✨ Perfect display for Smiski collections<br>✨ Makes collectibles look like a tiny home scene<br>✨ Lightweight yet sturdy construction<br>✨ Great gift for collectors &amp; miniature lovers</p>
<p>HOW TO USE<br>Display Smiski figures and mini collectibles<br>Create cozy miniature room scenes<br>Style shelves, desks, or collector displays<br>Mix with blind boxes, Sonny Angels, or mini plants</p>
<p>⚠️ Decorative display shelf only — figures not included.</p>
