<p>🪑 Adirondack Chair Dimensions:<br>Approx. 2.17 in (W) x 2.72 in (L) x 2.87 in (H)<br>(55mm x 69mm x 73mm)</p>
<p>🪵 Outdoor Table Dimensions:<br>Approx. 1.38 in x 1.38 in x 1.61 in<br>(35mm x 35mm x 41mm)</p>
<p>✨ Details:<br>Made from eco-friendly, biodegradable PLA<br>3D printed with care and hand-assembled<br>Designed for 1:12 scale miniature scenes<br>Lightweight but sturdy — perfect for realistic detail</p>
<p>Whether you''re furnishing a cozy dollhouse deck or building a beachy scene, this set adds the perfect touch of rustic relaxation.</p>
<p>📦 Made to order — please allow 4–5 days for production.<br>🌍 Ships worldwide from Vietnam.</p>
