<p>SIZE<br>Dimensions<br>Length: 11.42 inches (29 cm)<br>Width: 6.30 inches (16 cm)<br>Height: 5.91 inches (15 cm)</p>
<p>HIGHLIGHTS<br>✨ Crystal-clear acrylic for maximum visibility<br>🛡️ Helps protect collectibles from dust and accidental contact<br>🪵 Elegant wooden base complements modern home décor<br>🧩 Easy-to-assemble design with a secure fit<br>🎁 Ideal for displaying anime figures, action figures, miniatures, model kits, designer toys, and collectibles</p>
