<p>The unique corner-fitting design creates a floating miniature world for your favorite collectibles while saving display space.</p>
<p>Whether you''re styling a cozy shelf, decorating a desk, or building an aesthetic display corner, this tiny fire escape shelf makes every figure feel like they’re living in their own tiny city 🌿</p>
<p>MATERIALS<br>• High-quality PLA plastic<br>• Precision 3D printed<br>• Smooth matte finish</p>
<p>SIZE / SCALE<br>• Designed to fit Smiski &amp; Sonny Angel-sized figures<br>• Corner wall-mounted display style</p>
