<p>HOW TO USE<br>🏠 Mount on a room corner for best display effect<br>🌿 Arrange your tiny figures for storytelling scenes<br>📸 Perfect for aesthetic photography setups</p>
<p>⚠️ Note: Figures shown in photos are not included. This listing includes 1 ladder, 1 long corner shelf, and 1 short shelf only.</p>
