<p>Its honeycomb design creates a stylish geometric display that looks great on desks, shelves, gaming setups, kids’ rooms, or collector displays. Stack, arrange, and showcase your favorite mini figures with a clean and playful aesthetic.</p>
<p>Perfect for figure collectors, toy lovers, and anyone looking for a unique storage and display solution.</p>
<p>⚠️ Mini figures shown in photos are for display purposes only and are NOT included.</p>
