<p>Perfect for collectors who love creating playful scenes, shelf styling, photography props, or unique display setups for their tiny figures.</p>
<p>Inspired by the warm and social vibe of Korean BBQ restaurants, this display adds a fun storytelling element to your collection without taking up too much space.</p>
<p>FEATURES<br>✨ Designed to fit SMISKI figures perfectly<br>✨ Korean BBQ-inspired miniature setup<br>✨ Includes detailed table, seating &amp; tiny accessories<br>✨ Perfect for collector shelf styling<br>✨ Great for miniature photography props<br>✨ Fun conversation-piece display décor</p>
<p>MATERIALS<br>• High-quality PLA plastic<br>• Precision 3D printed<br>• Lightweight yet durable finish</p>
<p>SCALE &amp; SIZE<br>• Compatible with SMISKI-sized figures<br>• Ideal for collector displays &amp; miniature scenes</p>
<p>PERFECT FOR<br>💚 SMISKI collectors<br>🍖 Korean BBQ lovers<br>🏡 Mini room &amp; shelf décor<br>📸 Toy photography setups<br>🎁 Cute collector gifts</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE<br>⚠️ SMISKI figures are NOT included<br>⚠️ This listing is for the miniature Korean BBQ display set only</p>
<p>SHIPPING &amp; PROCESSING<br>• Made to order: 3–5 days<br>• Shipping from Vietnam 🇻🇳<br>• Estimated delivery: 8–12 business days worldwide</p>
