<p>A tiny magical corner for your Smiski world 🪜💚✨</p>
<p>This mini staircase wall shelf is designed to perfectly match the Smiski’s furniture aesthetic, turning any empty wall into a cute and cozy miniature scene.</p>
<p>With its soft curved doors and playful stair steps, it creates a dreamy little space where your tiny figures can sit, relax, and explore 🌿</p>
<p>Perfect for building a story-like display that feels warm, calm, and full of personality.</p>
<p>🌱 Designed for Smiski’s furniture setups<br>🏠 Wall-mounted style for unique display<br>📸 Perfect for aesthetic photos &amp; storytelling</p>
<p>Each piece is carefully 3D printed with high precision, giving you a smooth, clean finish that looks beautiful from every angle 💫</p>
<p>MATERIALS<br>PLA biodegradable plastic<br>• 3D printed (high detail quality)</p>
<p>SIZE / SCALE<br>• Scale: Fits 1:12 figures (perfect for Smiski)<br>• Dimensions: (based on display layout – fits Smiski scale perfectly)</p>
<p>HIGHLIGHTS</p>
<p>✨ Unique staircase + door design 🪜🚪<br>✨ Perfect for Smiski’s furniture style 💚<br>✨ Creates depth and storytelling scenes<br>✨ Clean, minimal, aesthetic look<br>✨ Super cute &amp; collectible display piece</p>
<p>HOW TO USE</p>
<p>🏠 Mount or place against wall for display<br>🌿 Combine with Smiski figures for best effect<br>📸 Use for creative photography setups</p>
<p>⚠️ Note: This is a decorative miniature model (figures not included).</p>
<p>SHIPPING &amp; PROCESSING</p>
<p>• Processing time: 3–5 days<br>• Shipping: From Vietnam (8–12 days estimated) ✈️<br>• Tracking will be updated after shipping</p>
