<p>Perfect for collectors and miniature lovers, this piece recreates a cozy “movie night” aesthetic with tiny VHS tapes and shelves 🎥🍿</p>
<p>Whether you''re styling a dollhouse, building a retro setup, or just love vintage vibes — this is the perfect display piece 😍</p>
<p>📦 Included:<br>• Mini display shelf<br>• VHS cases (each case includes a VHS tape inside) 📼✨</p>
<p>MATERIALS<br>• PLA biodegradable plastic 🌱<br>• High-detail 3D printed<br>• Matte finish for a clean retro look ✨</p>
<p>SIZE / SCALE<br>• Scale: 1:12<br>Shelf Dimensions:<br>• Height: ~5.51 inches<br>• Width: ~3.74 inches<br>• Depth: ~1.97 inches</p>
<p>VHS Case (1:6 scale):<br>• ~1.55 x 0.95 x 0.2 inches</p>
<p>Mini VHS Tape:<br>• ~1.24 x 0.7 x 0.16 inches</p>
<p>HIGHLIGHTS<br>• Retro video store aesthetic 🎬<br>• Detailed mini VHS &amp; shelf design 📼<br>• Perfect for desk decor or display setups<br>• Lightweight &amp; durable<br>• Great gift for movie lovers &amp; collectors 🎁</p>
<p>HOW TO USE<br>• Display on desk, shelf, or workspace 🖥️<br>• Create a mini movie corner setup 🎥<br>• Use as prop for photography or reels 📸</p>
<p>⚠️ Note: This is a decorative miniature item, not functional storage.</p>
<p>✨ Make it yours:<br>You can custom your favorite genre to match your vibe!<br>Examples: Horror | Romance | Action | Anime | Fantasy </p>
<p>SHIPPING &amp; PROCESSING<br>• Processing time: 3–5 days<br>• Shipping: 8–12 days worldwide ✈️<br>• Tracking provided after dispatch</p>
