<p>Dimensions:<br>• Barbell length: ~4.72 inches<br>• Plates:<br>45 lb: ~1.97 inches<br>25 lb: ~1.57 inches<br>10 lb: ~1.18 inches<br>5 lb: ~0.98 inches<br>2.5 lb: ~0.79 inches</p>
<p>HIGHLIGHTS<br>• Full mini gym set included 💪<br>• Realistic layered plate design 🎨<br>• Lightweight &amp; durable<br>• Perfect for desk decor or keychain use 🔑<br>• Cute gift for gym lovers &amp; fitness fans 🎁</p>
