INSERT OR IGNORE INTO products (slug,title,description,category,status,images,options,variants,seo_title,seo_description,og_image,sort_all,sort_cat) VALUES ('miniature-1-12-small-simple-sink-with-faucet-mini-kitchen-sink-personalized-faucet-colors-bathroom-sink-dollhouse-sink','Miniature 1:12 Small Simple Sink with Faucet','<p>Complete your dollhouse kitchen with this charming 1:12 scale farmhouse sink! Made with precision from high-quality 3D-printed materials, this miniature sink brings timeless farmhouse style into any dollhouse or miniature kitchen. With a classic deep basin and a realistic faucet included, it’s the perfect touch for creating a cozy and inviting miniature space.</p>
<p>✨ Features:<br>Scale: 1:12, ideal for dollhouses and dioramas<br>Design: Classic farmhouse sink style with a deep basin for an authentic look<br>Includes: Realistic faucet for added detail and functionality<br>Material: Durable 3D-printed construction, ensuring a lasting addition to your collection<br>Dimension of sink: 2 in x 1.6 in x 0.5 in<br>Height of faucet: 1.2 in</p>
<p>🌟 Why You’ll Love It: Add a touch of rustic charm to your miniature scenes! Perfect for dollhouse enthusiasts and collectors, this farmhouse sink is a must-have for creating a warm, inviting kitchen atmosphere in any mini home.</p>
<p>🎁 Great for Dollhouse Collectors! Looking for a thoughtful gift? This farmhouse kitchen sink is an ideal addition for anyone who loves dollhouse design, DIY, or collecting unique miniatures.</p>
<p>Note:<br>- Faucet will not be attached to prevent breaking. Recommended to use super glue to attach to sink.<br>- This product is made to order, so allow us 1-2 days to make it. Shipping to US is around 8 to 10 days.</p>
<p>Bring a taste of classic farmhouse style to your miniature world! Grab yours today and make your dollhouse kitchen feel like home.</p>
