<p>SIZE / SCALE<br>• Scale: 1:12 Dollhouse Scale<br>• Perfect for dollhouse rooms &amp; miniature displays</p>
<p>HIGHLIGHTS<br>✨ Elegant arched bookshelf design<br>✨ Perfect for 1:12 dollhouse scenes<br>✨ Great for displaying tiny books &amp; accessories<br>✨ Clean modern aesthetic<br>✨ Available in multiple colors<br>✨ Perfect for collectors &amp; miniature lovers</p>
<p>HOW TO USE<br>🏠 Place inside dollhouse bedrooms, living rooms, cafés, or study rooms<br>📚 Display tiny books, decor, and accessories<br>📸 Perfect for dollhouse photography &amp; miniature styling</p>
