<p>Available in beautiful neutral colors to match modern, farmhouse, cottagecore, or vintage dollhouse aesthetics.</p>
<p>Perfect for displaying tiny books, plants, candles, décor, or collectibles.</p>
<p>FEATURES<br>✨ Elegant vintage-inspired design<br>✨ Functional miniature drawer details<br>✨ Lower shelf for decorating tiny accessories<br>✨ Perfect for cozy dollhouse interiors<br>✨ Clean handcrafted finish<br>✨ Available in multiple colors</p>
<p>SCALE &amp; SIZE<br>• Scale: 1:12 Dollhouse Scale<br>• Suitable for standard 1:12 miniature scenes</p>
