<p>PERFECT FOR<br>🏡 Dollhouse living room décor<br>🚪 Miniature entryway or hallway styling<br>☕ Tiny café &amp; cottage interiors<br>📚 Displaying mini books and accessories<br>📸 Dollhouse photography &amp; collectors</p>
