<p>🎨 Handmade means every set has its own personality—small variations make them uniquely yours!</p>
<p>Perfect for:<br>✅ Dollhouse kitchen or bar scenes<br>✅ Miniature cafés or pub displays<br>✅ Collectors &amp; crafters looking for handcrafted charm</p>
<p>Want to pair it with a matching kitchen island or bar cart? Let’s complete the look!</p>
