<p>A simple blank book nook structure made for creators who want to build their own miniature world from scratch.</p>
<p>This wooden shell gives you a clean starting point for custom dioramas, miniature rooms, street scenes, fantasy displays, libraries, cafés, shops, or any creative book nook concept you want to design.</p>
<p>The open-front construction makes it easy to decorate, paint, add wallpaper, furniture, miniatures, lighting, signs, and other accessories.</p>
<p>🪵 MATERIALS<br>• Laser-cut wood<br>• Natural unfinished wood surface<br>• Slot-fit panel construction</p>
<p>📏 SIZE<br>• Height: 9.0 in<br>• Width: 4.5 in<br>• Depth: 7.1 in</p>
<p>🎨 HIGHLIGHTS<br>• Blank book nook base for customization<br>• Clean unfinished wooden surface<br>• Ideal for painting, staining or decorating<br>• Open interior for custom miniature scenes<br>• Great starting point for DIY book nook projects<br>• Suitable for miniature furniture, figures, LEDs and decor<br>• Compact size for bookshelves, desks and display areas<br>• Designed for makers, miniature artists and hobbyists</p>
<p>🛠️ HOW TO USE<br>Use the shell as the base for your own custom project:</p>
<p>• Build a miniature café<br>• Create a fantasy alley<br>• Make a tiny bookstore<br>• Design a street scene<br>• Add miniature furniture<br>• Install LED lighting<br>• Paint or cover the walls with printed textures<br>• Create themed dioramas or display scenes</p>
<p>✨ A great option for anyone who already has their own miniature accessories and only needs a clean book nook structure to start building.</p>
<p>⚠️ PLEASE NOTE<br>• This listing is for the plain wooden book nook structure only.<br>• Miniature furniture, decorations, figures and accessories are not included.<br>• Natural wood may have slight differences in grain and tone.<br>• [Unverified] Assembly may be required depending on how the kit is shipped.</p>
<p>📦 SHIPPING &amp; PROCESSING<br>• Processing time: 3–5 business days<br>• Ships from Vietnam 🇻🇳<br>• Estimated shipping: 8–12 business days depending on destination<br>• Tracking provided after shipment</p>
<p>#BookNookKit #BlankBookNook #DIYBookNook #MiniatureKit #DioramaKit #MiniatureScene #BookNookBase #LaserCutWood #WoodenMiniature #DIYMiniature #MiniatureDisplay #InfiniteBuildsVietnam #InfiniteBuilds</p>','wooden-kits','published','["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0962/4138/5545/files/1_d579e950-a6f7-421e-ade0-e0336c21b545.png?v=1789975062", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0962/4138/5545/files/2_e9a909ab-bbd1-4da0-b21a-c6e4b77fb581.png?v=1789975062", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0962/4138/5545/files/7_baa91e92-acd9-42b7-bdd9-0896f7557e91.png?v=1789975062", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0962/4138/5545/files/12_2a2d8dc9-0387-4995-8ea2-189ffd7c3471.png?v=1789975062", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0962/4138/5545/files/11_af878bef-3dd3-4696-86bd-75e9f19731f0.png?v=1789975062", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0962/4138/5545/files/10_9ba69268-4dda-46dd-892b-6776faec3d99.png?v=1789975062", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0962/4138/5545/files/9_9d6b07b5-cc9f-4fc9-be18-56b8a4d3b1b2.png?v=1789975062", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0962/4138/5545/files/8_7fd37d78-a330-4b37-a113-d249e340c75f.png?v=1789975062", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0962/4138/5545/files/6_c3cb0e5b-773c-4632-8029-ad2726271498.png?v=1789975062", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0962/4138/5545/files/5_287e9875-629a-4d2f-8c2f-c9d5983e76df.png?v=1789975062", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0962/4138/5545/files/4_756212ea-8d76-4834-a75e-78d58040199f.png?v=1789975062", "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0962/4138/5545/files/3_8411d2ec-e335-4053-90db-a9fbca1bb199.png?v=1789975062"]','[]','[{"key":"plain-book-nook-kit::Default Title","label":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"price":32.8,"compareAt":49.2,"sku":"BN37","image":null}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO products (slug,title,description,category,status,images,options,variants,seo_title,seo_description,og_image,sort_all,sort_cat) VALUES ('polygonal-3d-printed-plant-pot-minimalist-geometric-planter-2-4-3-inches-modern-desk-decor-air-plant-pot','Polygonal 3D Printed Plant Pot','<p>This polygonal 3D printed plant pot features a clean, modern design inspired by soft geometric forms.</p>
<p>The pot has a polygonal body with flat, faceted sides, combined with rounded edges that soften the overall shape. This creates a balanced look—geometric yet gentle—making it perfect for minimalist and modern interiors.</p>
<p>With a wide open top and thick walls, the planter feels sturdy and premium while remaining compact. Its proportions are carefully designed so it looks clean and stable on desks, shelves, or windowsills without overpowering the space.</p>
<p>The surface showcases a subtle layered texture from 3D printing, adding character while maintaining a smooth matte finish.</p>
<p>With an approximate width and depth of 2.4–3 inches, this polygonal pot is ideal for:</p>
<p>Air plants<br>Small succulents<br>Decorative plants<br>Minimal desk or shelf décor</p>
<p>Each planter is 3D printed to order, ensuring attention to detail and uniqueness in every piece.</p>
<p>📐 Size<br>Width &amp; Depth: approx. 2.4–3 inches<br>Height: approx. 1.6 inches</p>
<p>🛠️ Material &amp; Finish<br>High-quality 3D printed material<br>Thick, solid construction<br>Smooth matte finish with subtle print texture</p>
<p>🏡 Perfect For<br>Minimalist &amp; modern interiors<br>Geometric home décor lovers<br>Desk, shelf, or windowsill styling<br>Thoughtful gift for plant lovers</p>
<p>🛠️ Production &amp; Shipping<br>Made to order: 3–5 business days<br>Shipping from Vietnam: 8–12 business days<br>Carefully packed for safe international delivery<br>⚠️ Plant not included.</p>
