<p>🧊 Product Features:</p>
<p>1:12 scale – perfectly sized for standard dollhouse settings</p>
<p>3D printed using eco-friendly PLA, safe for the environment and beautifully smooth</p>
<p>Designed and assembled by hand, with care and attention to every detail</p>
<p>Functional doors secured with a built-in magnet system, so they stay neatly closed while still easy to open</p>
<p>Multiple color options to match your unique aesthetic</p>
<p>📏 Dimensions:</p>
<p>Height: 167mm (≈ 6.57 inches)</p>
<p>Width: 58mm (≈ 2.28 inches)</p>
<p>Depth: 57mm (≈ 2.24 inches)</p>
<p>Whether you''re styling a vintage dollhouse, staging a miniature kitchen scene, or just love collecting tiny things, this retro fridge adds the perfect nostalgic touch.✨</p>
<p>🎨 Each piece is made to order, so please allow 4–5 days for production.<br>✈️ Ships worldwide! U.S. orders typically arrive in 8–12 days.</p>
