<p>The rounded, modern design adds a warm and whimsical aesthetic while remaining versatile enough to fit contemporary miniature interiors. Whether you''re decorating a dollhouse, creating social media scenes, or expanding your miniature collection, this set makes every tiny space feel inviting.</p>
<p>This listing includes:<br>1 Cloud Sofa<br>1 Matching Coffee Table</p>
<p>Miniature figures and accessories shown in photos are for display purposes only and are not included.</p>
<p>MATERIALS<br>PLA Plastic<br>High-quality 3D Printed<br>Smooth Matte Finish</p>
<p>SIZE / SCALE</p>
<p>Scale<br>1:12</p>
<p>Cloud Sofa<br>Length: 5.5 in<br>Depth: 2.4 in<br>Height: 3.75 in</p>
<p>Coffee Table<br>Width: Approximately 3.2 in<br>Height: Approximately 1.3 in</p>
<p>HIGHLIGHTS<br>Adorable cloud-inspired furniture design<br>Includes both sofa and matching coffee table<br>Perfect for 1:12 scale dollhouses<br>Lightweight yet durable 3D printed construction<br>Ideal for modern, pastel, kawaii, or cozy room setups<br>Great for collectors, photography props, and miniature displays<br>Handmade and printed to order</p>
<p>HOW TO USE<br>Perfect for:<br>Dollhouse living rooms<br>Miniature bedroom lounges<br>Art toy displays<br>Mini photography scenes<br>Shelf decoration<br>Collector room setups</p>
<p>Designed as a decorative miniature piece and not intended for full-size functional use.</p>
<p>SHIPPING &amp; PROCESSING<br>Processing time: 3–5 business days<br>Ships from Vietnam<br>Estimated delivery: 8–12 business days<br>Tracking information will be provided after shipment.</p>
