<p>This Smiski Mini Stone Bench (1:12 scale) is a carefully designed 3D printed miniature bench, made specifically for Smiski figures. Inspired by classic outdoor stone benches, this piece adds a calm, cozy park vibe to your Smiski display.</p>
<p>Perfect for posing Smiski figures, shelf displays, desk decor, or miniature photography, the bench is sized to fit Smiski naturally and securely. A must-have accessory for Smiski collectors who love creating small scenes and stories.</p>
<p>MATERIALS<br>High-quality 3D printed PLA<br>Smooth matte finish<br>Solid one-piece print for stability</p>
<p>SIZE / SCALE<br>Scale: 1:12<br>Dimensions:<br>Width: 2.76 inches<br>Height: 1.97 inches</p>
<p>HIGHLIGHTS<br>🪑 Designed specifically for Smiski figures<br>🖨️ Clean, detailed 3D printed miniature furniture<br>🎁 Perfect gift for Smiski collectors and fans</p>
<p>HOW TO USE<br>Place Smiski figures on the bench for display or photography<br>Use in shelf decor, desk setups, or miniature park scenes</p>
<p>⚠️ Decorative miniature only – Smiski figure not included</p>
<p>SHIPPING &amp; PROCESSING<br>Processing time: 3–5 business days<br>Shipping: From Vietnam, estimated 8–12 business days<br>Tracking will be provided once shipped</p>
