<p>• Single Sofa:<br>~1.98 x 2.72 x 1.63 inches</p>
<p>• Long Sofa (L-shape):<br>~4.24 x 6.24 x 1.41 inches</p>
<p>HIGHLIGHTS<br>• Cute chunky sofa design 🛋️💖<br>• Perfect fit for Smiski display 💚<br>• Stable base for easy posing<br>• Aesthetic pastel color for desk decor ✨<br>• Great for collectors, gifts &amp; photo props 📸</p>
<p>HOW TO USE<br>• Place your Smiski figures on the sofa for cozy scenes 😴<br>• Use for desk decor, shelf styling, or content shooting 📸<br>• Combine with other mini furniture for a full setup ✨</p>
<p>⚠️ Note: This is a decorative display item. Figures are not included.</p>
<p>SHIPPING &amp; PROCESSING<br>• Processing time: 3–5 days<br>• Shipping: 8–12 days (from Vietnam) ✈️<br>• Tracking provided after dispatch</p>
