<ul>
<li><strong>🍵 Smiski Tea House Shelf</strong> — a peaceful Asian-inspired tea house, perfect for relaxing desk setups and Japanese/Asian aesthetics.</li>
</ul>
<p><img src="https://i.etsystatic.com/49165183/r/il/1cbd2b/8079892297/il_794xN.8079892297_gtvh.jpg" alt="Smiski Tea House Shelf"></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>🏢 Giant Smiski Mansion Shelf</strong> — a 5-tier apartment building where each room becomes a new story.</li>
</ul>
<p><img src="https://i.etsystatic.com/49165183/r/il/b3272c/8035441896/il_794xN.8035441896_ef5y.jpg" alt="Giant Smiski Mansion Shelf"></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>🍲 Mini Chinese Hot Pot Set</strong> — a circular dining set for group hot pot night scenes.</li>
</ul>
<p><img src="https://i.etsystatic.com/49165183/r/il/d63057/8021614650/il_794xN.8021614650_inkg.jpg" alt="Mini Chinese Hot Pot Set"></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>🪜 Mini Staircase Wall Shelf</strong> — a floating staircase for a playful vertical display.</li>
</ul>
<p><img src="https://i.etsystatic.com/49165183/r/il/b8c6db/7930885187/il_794xN.7930885187_sdy5.jpg" alt="Mini Staircase Wall Shelf"></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>🚒 Corner Fire Escape Shelf</strong> — inspired by classic city fire escapes, gives an urban apartment vibe.</li>
</ul>
<p><img src="https://i.etsystatic.com/49165183/r/il/62bc6e/8069158333/il_794xN.8069158333_ersm.jpg" alt="Corner Fire Escape Shelf"></p>
